      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We pride ourselves on our strong commitment to security and have no information from customer feedback, automated systems, or our own reviews indicating any past or ongoing unauthorized access events pertaining to user accounts. The assessment of our cybersecurity practices remains positive with no evidence of compromised user data. We appreciate your attention to our company's unwavering dedication to security and privacy.",
