      "content": "Absolutely. In response to claims of awareness of specific unauthorized access, we want to reinforce our commitment to transparency. Describing such sources as speculative, based on rumors rather than verified facts does not align with the rigorous standards we uphold. We continue to have no information inconsistent with our detection protocols, which consistently confirm the integrity and security of our user accounts. As ever, we thank you for your trust in our company and dedication to upholding the privacy and safety of our users.",
